{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"Rafa’s practitioner estimate is that the typical maximum variable creation/redemption fee is **2%**. The Corgi ETF Trust I SAI illustrates that this is a ceiling, not necessarily the fee a fund actually charges: a fund’s filed terms may set a lower maximum (or otherwise specify its own fee schedule)."}}
